Wedding Budget Breakdown: Where the Money Actually Goes

A realistic wedding budget breakdown by category:
• venue and catering: 40–50%;
• photography and video: 10–15%;
• flowers and décor: 8–10%;
• music: 8–10%;
• attire and beauty: 5–8%;
• a planner or coordinator: 5–10%;
• stationery and extras: 4–6%;
• a 5% buffer for the unexpected.

Plus where couples overspend and how to save without cutting the parts you'll remember.

